    "Id": "chassisdef_kohlen_K-112",
    "Name": "Kohlen",
    "Details": "The Kohlen K-112 arms a rock cutter in the right arm capable of breaking down anything from pebbles to boulders, paired with a mining drill in the left arm for reaching deeper depths. Twin lift hoists, a searchlight and environmental sealing support deep mining operations. Two sprayers draws from a ten ton shared liquid compartment holding water for dust suppression, drilling coolant to keep the drill and cutter from overheating, and fire suppressant foam for containing gas pocket ignitions.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.87</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Crosscut"
  },
